{"seq":4,"slug":"jupyter","title":"Jupyter 与交互式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/jupyter","wordCount":1166,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"jupyter-与交互式分析\">Jupyter 与交互式分析</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Jupyter Notebook 将代码、输出、可视化和叙述性文字整合在一个交互式文档中，是数据科学工作流的标准工具。本文介绍 Jupyter 的核心功能、高效使用技巧，以及现代替代方案 JupyterLab 和 VS Code Notebooks。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Jupyter 的核心是<strong>以 Cell 为单位、由内核（kernel）保持状态</strong>的交互模型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cell 是执行单元</strong>：Code 执行代码、Markdown 写叙述、Raw 存原始文本，前后 Cell 共享同一个内核状态。</li>\n<li><strong>执行顺序不等于排列顺序</strong>：内核按执行先后维护变量，Cell 上下移动不会改变已运行的顺序，这是&quot;重启后结果不一致&quot;的根源，故需定期 &quot;Restart &amp; Run All&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>魔法命令是语法扩展</strong>：<code>%</code> 行魔法作用于单行，<code>%%</code> 单元魔法作用于整个 Cell。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cell 类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>是否共享内核状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Code</td>\n<td>执行 Python 代码</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Markdown</td>\n<td>叙述性文字</td>\n<td>否（渲染展示）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Raw</td>\n<td>原始文本</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从&quot;探索工具&quot;走向&quot;工程化&quot;需要三步：把可复用逻辑抽到 <code>.py</code> 模块、用 <code>nbstripout</code> 清除输出后再提交、用 <code>papermill</code> 参数化批量执行。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安装与启动\">安装与启动</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install jupyterlab notebook&#10;jupyter lab&#10;jupyter notebook\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jupyterlab</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> notebook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jupyter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jupyter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> notebook</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Jupyter Notebook</td>\n<td>经典界面，轻量</td>\n<td>快速原型、教学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JupyterLab</td>\n<td>完整 IDE 体验</td>\n<td>日常分析工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VS Code Notebooks</td>\n<td>与编辑器深度集成</td>\n<td>工程化项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Colab</td>\n<td>免费 GPU，云端运行</td>\n<td>机器学习实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>JupyterLab 是 Jupyter Notebook 的下一代界面，支持多标签页、文件浏览器、终端、扩展系统等 IDE 特性。相比经典 Notebook，JupyterLab 更适合需要同时查看多个文件、对比数据、运行终端命令的复杂分析场景。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cell-类型与执行\">Cell 类型与执行</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cell 类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Code</td>\n<td>执行 Python 代码</td>\n<td>Shift+Enter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Markdown</td>\n<td>叙述性文字</td>\n<td>Shift+Enter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Raw</td>\n<td>原始文本</td>\n<td>少用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常用快捷键\">常用快捷键</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n<th>命令模式操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>A</code></td>\n<td>在上方插入 Cell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>B</code></td>\n<td>在下方插入 Cell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DD</code></td>\n<td>删除当前 Cell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>M</code></td>\n<td>切换为 Markdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Y</code></td>\n<td>切换为 Code</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Ctrl+/</code></td>\n<td>注释/取消注释</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Jupyter 有两种模式：命令模式（按 Esc 进入，Cell 边框为蓝色）和编辑模式（按 Enter 进入，Cell 边框为绿色）。上述快捷键仅在命令模式下生效。熟练使用快捷键可以大幅提升 Notebook 的编辑效率——避免频繁使用鼠标点击菜单。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"魔法命令\">魔法命令</h2><h3 id=\"行魔法-line-magic\">行魔法（Line Magic）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"%timeit sum(range(1000))&#10;%who str&#10;%pwd&#10;%load_ext autoreload&#10;%autoreload 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timeit </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">who </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pwd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">load_ext autoreload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">autoreload </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"单元魔法-cell-magic\">单元魔法（Cell Magic）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"%%time&#10;import numpy as np&#10;result = np.random.randn(10_000_000).sum()&#10;&#10;%%writefile script.py&#10;print(&quot;Hello from script!&quot;)&#10;&#10;%%bash&#10;echo &quot;Current directory:&quot;&#10;pwd\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">writefile script.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello from script!\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">echo </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Current directory:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pwd</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用魔法命令速查\">常用魔法命令速查</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>%timeit</code></td>\n<td>精确计时（多次运行取平均）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%%time</code></td>\n<td>单次运行计时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%matplotlib inline</code></td>\n<td>内联显示图表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%autoreload 2</code></td>\n<td>自动重载修改的模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%who</code> / <code>%whos</code></td>\n<td>列出当前变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%store</code></td>\n<td>跨 Notebook 共享变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%pdb</code></td>\n<td>异常时自动进入调试器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>%autoreload 2</code> 是开发阶段最实用的魔法命令之一。它让 Jupyter 在每次执行 Cell 前自动重新加载已修改的外部模块，这样修改 <code>.py</code> 文件后无需重启内核就能看到效果。对于将逻辑封装在外部模块、仅在 Notebook 中调用的工作模式来说不可或缺。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"富文本输出\">富文本输出</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from IPython.display import display, HTML, Markdown, Image&#10;&#10;display(Markdown(&quot;### 这是一个标题&quot;))&#10;display(HTML(&quot;&lt;b style=&#39;color:red&#39;&gt;红色加粗&lt;/b&gt;&quot;))&#10;display(Image(url=&quot;https://example.com/chart.png&quot;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IPython.display </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> display, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">HTML</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Markdown, Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">display(Markdown(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"### 这是一个标题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">display(HTML(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;b style='color:red'>红色加粗&#x3C;/b>\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">display(Image(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com/chart.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dataframe-美化显示\">DataFrame 美化显示</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;df = pd.DataFrame({&quot;name&quot;: [&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;], &quot;score&quot;: [95, 87]})&#10;df.style.highlight_max(color=&quot;lightgreen&quot;).format({&quot;score&quot;: &quot;{:.1f}&quot;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">87</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.style.highlight_max(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lightgreen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).format({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ipywidgets-交互组件\">ipywidgets 交互组件</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import ipywidgets as widgets&#10;from IPython.display import display&#10;&#10;slider = widgets.IntSlider(value=50, min=0, max=100, description=&quot;阈值:&quot;)&#10;&#10;@widgets.interact(threshold=(0, 100, 5))&#10;def filter_data(threshold=50):&#10;    filtered = df[df[&quot;score&quot;] &gt;= threshold]&#10;    display(filtered)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ipywidgets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> widgets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IPython.display </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> display</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">slider </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> widgets.IntSlider(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"阈值:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@widgets.interact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> filter_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    filtered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df[df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    display(filtered)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"notebook-工程化\">Notebook 工程化</h2><h3 id=\"nbconvert-导出\">nbconvert 导出</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"jupyter nbconvert --to html analysis.ipynb&#10;jupyter nbconvert --to pdf analysis.ipynb&#10;jupyter nbconvert --to script analysis.ipynb\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jupyter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nbconvert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> html</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analysis.ipynb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jupyter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nbconvert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analysis.ipynb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jupyter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nbconvert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analysis.ipynb</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"papermill-参数化执行\">papermill 参数化执行</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install papermill&#10;papermill input.ipynb output.ipynb -p dataset_path &quot;data/2024.csv&quot; -p threshold 0.8\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> papermill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">papermill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.ipynb</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output.ipynb</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dataset_path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"data/2024.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> threshold</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>nbconvert</td>\n<td>格式转换</td>\n<td>生成报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>papermill</td>\n<td>参数化批量执行</td>\n<td>自动化流水线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nbstripout</td>\n<td>清除输出后提交</td>\n<td>Git 版本控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jupytext</td>\n<td>Notebook ↔ .py 互转</td>\n<td>代码审查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"notebook-与-git-版本控制\">Notebook 与 Git 版本控制</h3><p>Notebook 的 <code>.ipynb</code> 文件本质是 JSON，包含代码、输出、元数据。直接提交到 Git 会产生巨大的 diff（尤其是内嵌图片的 base64 数据）。标准做法是在 <code>.gitattributes</code> 中配置 <code>nbstripout</code> 作为 clean filter，提交前自动清除所有输出。配合 <code>jupytext</code> 可以同时维护 <code>.py</code> 纯文本版本用于代码审查。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"notebook-最佳实践\">Notebook 最佳实践</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[探索阶段] --&gt; B[整理 Cell 顺序]&#10;  B --&gt; C[添加 Markdown 说明]&#10;  C --&gt; D[提取函数到 .py 模块]&#10;  D --&gt; E[参数化 + nbconvert 输出报告]\">graph TD\n  A[探索阶段] --&gt; B[整理 Cell 顺序]\n  B --&gt; C[添加 Markdown 说明]\n  C --&gt; D[提取函数到 .py 模块]\n  D --&gt; E[参数化 + nbconvert 输出报告]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>保持 Cell 短小精悍，每个 Cell 做一件事</li>\n<li>使用 Markdown Cell 记录分析思路，让 Notebook 自解释</li>\n<li>开启 <code>%autoreload 2</code> 避免重启内核</li>\n<li>使用 <code>nbstripout</code> 清除输出后再提交到 Git，避免大文件冲突</li>\n<li>将可复用逻辑提取到 <code>.py</code> 模块，Notebook 只做调用和展示</li>\n<li>定期 &quot;Restart &amp; Run All&quot; 确保 Cell 执行顺序正确</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Jupyter 以 Cell 为执行单元，由内核统一保持状态，执行顺序不等同于排列顺序。</li>\n<li>三种 Cell 类型：Code、Markdown、Raw；命令模式与编辑模式需区分。</li>\n<li>魔法命令分 <code>%</code> 行魔法与 <code>%%</code> 单元魔法，<code>%autoreload 2</code> 是开发阶段利器。</li>\n<li>富文本输出与 ipywidgets 让 Notebook 具备交互展示能力。</li>\n<li>工程化三板斧：nbconvert 导出、papermill 参数化执行、nbstripout 清输出后提交。</li>\n<li>保持 Cell 短小、用 Markdown 记录思路、定期 Restart &amp; Run All 保证可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Jupyter 与交互式分析","id":"jupyter-与交互式分析"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"安装与启动","id":"安装与启动"},{"level":2,"text":"Cell 类型与执行","id":"cell-类型与执行"},{"level":3,"text":"常用快捷键","id":"常用快捷键"},{"level":2,"text":"魔法命令","id":"魔法命令"},{"level":3,"text":"行魔法（Line Magic）","id":"行魔法-line-magic"},{"level":3,"text":"单元魔法（Cell Magic）","id":"单元魔法-cell-magic"},{"level":3,"text":"常用魔法命令速查","id":"常用魔法命令速查"},{"level":2,"text":"富文本输出","id":"富文本输出"},{"level":3,"text":"DataFrame 美化显示","id":"dataframe-美化显示"},{"level":2,"text":"ipywidgets 交互组件","id":"ipywidgets-交互组件"},{"level":2,"text":"Notebook 工程化","id":"notebook-工程化"},{"level":3,"text":"nbconvert 导出","id":"nbconvert-导出"},{"level":3,"text":"papermill 参数化执行","id":"papermill-参数化执行"},{"level":3,"text":"Notebook 与 Git 版本控制","id":"notebook-与-git-版本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Notebook 最佳实践","id":"notebook-最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据可视化 Matplotlib/Plotly","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/visualization"},"next":{"title":"项目结构与包管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/project-structure"}}